\c 41  
\d For the Chief Musician. A Psalm of David.  
\q1
\v 1 Blessed \w is|strong="H1732"\w* \w he|strong="H1732"\w* \w that|strong="H1732"\w* considereth \w the|strong="H1732"\w* poor:  
\q1 \w Jehovah|strong="H3068"\w* will deliver \w him|strong="H1732"\w* \w in|strong="H1732"\w* \w the|strong="H1732"\w* day \w of|strong="H4210"\w* evil.   
