\v 3 \w Jehovah|strong="H3068"\w* \w will|strong="H3068"\w* support \w him|strong="H5414"\w* \w upon|strong="H5414"\w* \w the|strong="H5414"\w* couch \w of|strong="H3068"\w* languishing:  
