\q1
\v 11 \w By|strong="H3068"\w* \w this|strong="H3068"\w* \w I|strong="H6965"\w* know \w that|strong="H3068"\w* thou delightest \w in|strong="H3068"\w* \w me|strong="H2603"\w*,  
