\ms1 BOOK II  
\c 42  
\d For the Chief Musician. Maschil of the sons of Korah.  
\q1
\v 1 \w As|strong="H1121"\w* \w the|strong="H1121"\w* hart panteth after \w the|strong="H1121"\w* water brooks,  
\q1 So panteth my soul after thee, \w O|strong="H3068"\w* God.   
\q1
\v 2 \w My|strong="H5921"\w* \w soul|strong="H5315"\w* thirsteth \w for|strong="H5921"\w* God, \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w living|strong="H5315"\w* God:  
\q1 \w When|strong="H5921"\w* \w shall|strong="H5315"\w* \w I|strong="H5921"\w* come \w and|strong="H4325"\w* appear \w before|strong="H5921"\w* God?   
